OL,3,ACatherine joins William as he says
OL,4,Asport can save lives from suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has made a
OL,7,Fsurprise appearance alongside her
OL,8,Fhusband the Prince of Wales, as he gave
OL,9,Fan impassioned call to the sports
OL,10,Fsector to help prevent suicides.
OL,12,F"Sport can help save lives," Prince
OL,13,FWilliam told sports players, mental
OL,14,Fhealth charities and sports industry
OL,15,Ffigures at Everton's football ground in
OL,16,FLiverpool.
OL,18,FHe was launching a project that wants
OL,19,Fto use sport to help open conversations
OL,20,Fand end the stigma surrounding mental
OL,21,Fhealth.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
